# The United States, in English: the shipped defaults (locales/en.json,
# presets/us-car-buyout.yaml, locales/privacy-policy.en.md). No secrets here:
# these are a country's settings, the starting point for a client's own file
# (SETUP.md, Another country), and what the demo for this country is built from.
